  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n62% of 2200 - 24% of (?) = 932\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n62% of 2200 - 24% of (?) = 932\n\n⇒ {(62/100) × 2200} - 24% of (?) = 932\n\n⇒ 1364 - 24% of (?) = 932\n\n⇒ 24% of (?) = 1364 - 932\n\n⇒ 24% of (?) = 432\n\n⇒ 6% of (?) = 108\n\n⇒ 1% of (?) = 18\n\n⇒ (1/100) × (?) = 18\n\n⇒ (?) = 1800\n\n**∴ The required answer is 1800.**",
